title: Pravda Names Us
subtitle: The Bolsheviks campaign against our policy.
new-page: true
tags: event
view-if: opp_bol_ev = 1 and bol_regime = 0
priority: 22
on-arrival: {!
Q.opp_bol_ev = 0;
Q.opp_bol_timer = 4;
Q.opp_bol_n = (Q.opp_bol_n || 0) + 1;
Q.opp_why = RO.mainGrievance(Q, 'bol');
!}

= Pravda Names Us

The Bolsheviks have found their cause. Every issue of Pravda carries a front-page article on [+ opp_why +], and Bolshevik agitators are in every barracks and every factory meeting with the same message: that the government is the bourgeoisie's, and that we are its hirelings.

They are not wrong that it is a weakness. The question is what to do about it.

- @concede: Adopt their demand.
- @debate: Debate them in the Soviet.
- @ignore: Ignore them.
- @break: Shut down Pravda and arrest the agitators.

@concede
on-arrival: {!
Q.opp_gave = RO.rollback(Q, 'bol');
Q.opp_gave_flag = Q.opp_gave ? 1 : 0;
RO.add(Q, {ant_bol: -25, rel_bol: 5, bolshevik: 3, ant_kad: 5});
RO.boost(Q, {workers: 2});
!}

[? if opp_gave_flag = 1 : We have changed [+ opp_gave +]. ?][? if opp_gave_flag = 0 : We have said that we share their concern, though there was nothing more to give. ?]Pravda says that it is a victory for the workers, which is what it would say whatever we did.

@debate
on-arrival: {!
Q.opp_won_debate = RO.chance(0.35 + (Q.soviet_democracy - 50) / 150) ? 1 : 0;
if (Q.opp_won_debate) { RO.add(Q, {ant_bol: -12, bolshevik: -2}); RO.boost(Q, {workers: 2}); }
else { RO.add(Q, {ant_bol: 3, bolshevik: 3}); RO.boost(Q, {workers: -1}); }
!}

The debate was held in the Soviet's plenary, in front of the delegates and the press. [? if opp_won_debate = 1 : Our speaker was better prepared, and the Soviet voted by a clear majority to endorse the government's course. ?][? if opp_won_debate = 0 : The Bolshevik speaker was better prepared, and the hall cheered him to the end. ?]

@ignore
on-arrival: {!
RO.add(Q, {bolshevik: 5});
RO.boost(Q, {workers: -3, soldiers: -2});
!}

We said nothing, and the Bolsheviks said everything. The garrisons and the factories are listening to them, and they are not listening to us.

@break
choose-if: strength >= 18
subtitle: Chance of breaking them: [+ odds_bol +]%. A failure makes them angrier.
unavailable-subtitle: We lack the force and the allies for this.
on-arrival: {!
RO.breakCamp(Q, 'bol');
!}

[+ sq_text +] The workers' districts will not forget it, whichever way it went.
